operties needs to be  seized  uh the honourable gentleman makes an  important point about ensuring that we  give  due publicity  to the uh people institutions and  entities that have been sanctioned i'll  ensure that the  suggestion that he has made  is listened to by the department  in december we brought our g7 partners  together in liverpool  to warn putin  that invading ukraine would have massive  consequences and indeed we have followed  through on that pledge we have worked  with our allies to cut off such sectors  of the russian economy by targeting its  defence companies its trade and  transport sector and kicking banks out  of the swift financial system  we have led the way in our financial  sanctions targeting 10 russian banks and  we have hit  over 300 billion pounds worth of russian  bank assets  all this amounts to the toughest  sanctions package of any country and we  will work with and encourage all our  allies to keep ratcheting up their  efforts  as well  we will continue  to provide lethal military aid  to ukraine we were the first european  country to send defensive weapons  and we have already donated over  3600 n-law anti-tank weapons and also  now supplying javelin missiles
 

